 alt="checkmark icon" loading="lazy"><p>Dedicated success manager</p></div><div class="pricing-table__feature  with-tooltip "><div class="tooltip"> Skip the queue with priority access to our support team. Get faster response times and dedicated help to keep your projects moving without delay.</div> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/bi_check-lg-1.svg"
 width="20"
