 alt="checkmark icon" loading="lazy"><p>Premium support</p></div><div class="pricing-table__feature  with-tooltip "><div class="tooltip"> Remove bias from your review process. Allow stakeholders to leave honest, anonymous feedback so your team can focus on the work, not the person behind the comment.</div> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/bi_check-lg-1.svg"
 width="20"
