 alt="" width="50"
 height="51" loading="lazy"> </picture></div><h3 class="icon__headline">75+ comments</h3><p class="icon__text">posted in context instead of getting lost in frustrating email chains</p></div></div><div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4"><div class="icon icon--h50"><div class="icon__image-container"> <picture> <source srcset="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Approve-check-done-review.webp" type="image/webp"> <source srcset="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Approve-check-done-review.jpg" type="image/jpeg"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="icon__image" src="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Approve-check-done-review.png"
 alt="Approve, check, done, review" width="50"
 height="51" loading="lazy"> </picture></div><h3 class="icon__headline">15+ approvals</h3><p class="icon__text">with full clarity of who said what and which version is the latest</p></div></div><div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4"><div class="icon icon--h50"><div class="icon__image-container"> <picture> <source srcset="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Time-clock-deadline-1.webp" type="image/webp"> <source srcset="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Time-clock-deadline-1.jpg" type="image/jpeg"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="icon__image" src="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Time-clock-deadline-1.webp"
 alt="" width="50"
 height="50" loading="lazy"> </picture></div><h3 class="icon__headline">50+ hours saved</h3><p class="icon__text">freeing teams up to deliver more campaigns with the same resources</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="testimonials-slider" data-block_7f39cc619fd51a4f7c13c7255b39cf1f ><div class="swiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="testimonials-slider__testimonial"><div class="testimonials-slider__top"> <img decoding="async" width="160" height="160" src="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/johannes-morath-1.webp" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="Johannes Morath" srcset="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/johannes-morath-1.webp 160w, https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/johannes-morath-1-150x150.webp 150w" sizes="(max-width: 160px) 100vw, 160px" / loading="lazy"><div class="testimonials-slider__sign"><p class="testimonials-slider__name">Johannes Morath</p><p>Manager Marketing Projects, Kärcher</p></div></div><p class="testimonials-slider__bold">Since rolling out Filestage, we’ve saved 100s of hours on our artwork reviews</p><p class="testimonials-slider__regular">Filestage gives our suppliers and agencies a centralized platform to submit creative assets for feedback and approval. This helps us deliver content at speed and scale.</p> <a href="https://filestage.io/customers/" class="button-arrow"
 > See all success stories </a></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="testimonials-slider__testimonial"><div class="testimonials-slider__top"> <img decoding="async" width="160" height="160" src="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/IMG_2904_1-2-e1724860777529-1.webp" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="Karina Berner" srcset="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/IMG_2904_1-2-e1724860777529-1.webp 160w, https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/IMG_2904_1-2-e1724860777529-1-150x150.webp 150w" sizes="(max-width: 160px) 100vw, 160px" / loading="lazy"><div class="testimonials-slider__sign"><p class="testimonials-slider__name">Karina Berner</p><p>Creative Production Specialist, Sartorius</p></div></div><p class="testimonials-slider__bold">Filestage saves our company a huge amount of time</p><p class="testimonials-slider__regular">Instead of writing detailed instructions over email, reviewers can just click on a file to add comments in context. This makes everything faster – from giving feedback, to managing the process, to making edits before sharing the next version.</p> <a href="https://filestage.io/customers/" class="button-arrow"
 > See all success stories </a></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="testimonials-slider__testimonial"><div class="testimonials-slider__top"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="160" height="177" src="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/photo-aesculap-zsolt-1.webp" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="Zsolt Arnodi" / loading="lazy"><div class="testimonials-slider__sign"><p class="testimonials-slider__name">Zsolt Arnodi</p><p>Digital Communication Specialist, B. Braun</p></div></div><p class="testimonials-slider__bold">Our review turnaround time has significantly improved</p><p class="testimonials-slider__regular">Filestage helps us reduce long email threads and revision loops by working more interactively and collaboratively.</p> <a href="https://filestage.io/customers/" class="button-arrow"
 > See all success stories </a></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="testimonials-slider__testimonial"><div class="testimonials-slider__top"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="378" height="400" src="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/photo-sharp-naeran.webp" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="photo-sharp-naeran" srcset="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/photo-sharp-naeran.webp 378w, https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/photo-sharp-naeran-284x300.webp 284w" sizes="(max-width: 378px) 100vw, 378px" / loading="lazy"><div class="testimonials-slider__sign"><p class="testimonials-slider__name">Naeran Rubio</p><p>Associate Director of Content &#038; Communications, Sharp</p></div></div><p class="testimonials-slider__bold">The process has become much more automated and simple</p><p class="testimonials-slider__regular">There have been quite a few instances where we were able to go back to something someone said in Filestage and make a correction that perhaps was missed, so the tool has proven to be very useful.</p> <a href="https://filestage.io/customers/" class="button-arrow"
 > See all success stories </a></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="testimonials-slider__testimonial"><div class="testimonials-slider__top"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="500" height="552" src="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/photo-sixt.aac78e74.webp" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="Angelika Schneider" srcset="https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/photo-sixt.aac78e74.webp 500w, https://filestage.io/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/photo-sixt.aac78e74-272x300.webp 272w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" / loading="lazy"><div class="testimonials-slider__sign"><p class="testimonials-slider__name">Angelika Schneider</p><p>Executive Creative Direction Motion Design, Sixt</p></div></div><p class="testimonials-slider__bold">Filestage has simplified the approval process for us and the departments we are working with</p><p class="testimonials-slider__regular">It is now much easier for us to process the collected feedback since we can access all the information in a single place.</p> <a href="https://filestage.io/customers/" class="button-arrow"
 > See all success stories </a></div></div></div><div class="testimonials-slider__navigation"><div class="testimonials-slider__navigation__buttons"> <button class="testimonial-button-prev button-big-arrow" aria-label="Previous testimonial"> <svg width="27" height="21" viewBox="0 0 27 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <g id="Group 861"> <path id="Vector" d="M25.5 10.5713L1.5 10.5713" stroke-width="3"
